    "title": "StaffDNA \u2013 Healthcare Careers",
    "description": "Take Control of Your Healthcare Career\u2122 with the StaffDNA Marketplace. \r\n \r\nStaffDNA gives healthcare professionals complete career control for higher-paying opportunities and flexibility. Search the highest-paying nursing and allied health positions in the country, no registration required. Apply to multiple jobs with 1-click and manage your healthcare career from anywhere. \r\n \r\nFind, Book, and Manage\u2122 your career from anywhere for free:\r\n1.\tMaximize income and build your own pay packages.\r\n2.\tCreate your profile and submit to jobs with 1-click.\r\n3.\tUpload timesheets, request extensions, and track compliance. \r\n \r\nDo all of this and more, from the first company to offer a complete healthcare marketplace for travel, local, staff, and per diem opportunities in a single mobile app.",
